Dungeon Crawl Stone Soup is developed by the Crawl contributors.
Upstream: https://github.com/crawl/crawl

The generated crawl_protocol.json, crawl_features.json, crawl_equipment.json,
and crawl_clouds.json tables describe public enum values, terrain names, and
tile appearances from the revision recorded in crawl-version.json. Their
generators read an external Crawl checkout; they do not read saved or live
game state. Fixtures record public protocol observations for adapter tests.

No Crawl source code, binary, tile images, or WebTiles client is distributed
in this repository. The optional spectator imports the user's external stock
WebTiles server and overlays its lobby renderer in a temporary directory.
Crawl's license and contributor notices remain in that external distribution.

The optional patch in patches/codex-replaceable-snapshots.patch targets OpenAI
Codex and includes upstream code context. Its upstream Apache License 2.0 and
notices are retained in patches/CODEX-LICENSE and patches/CODEX-NOTICE. The
Codex checkout and compiled package remain external.
